WEBVTT

00:34.240 --> 00:35.120
NANPU BRIDGE

00:40.840 --> 00:42.880
OUTPATIENT

00:42.960 --> 00:47.200
SEVEN DAYS AGO

00:49.120 --> 00:50.040
You are good.

00:50.120 --> 00:52.360
When you're in the operating room,
just keep blabbering.

01:00.000 --> 01:02.040
Doctor, minimally invasive
gallbladder removal

01:02.120 --> 01:03.640
isn't that dangerous, right?

01:03.720 --> 01:05.760
Our surgical technology
is very mature now,

01:05.840 --> 01:07.520
but everyone has a different constitution.

01:07.600 --> 01:10.400
I still suggest that Zhuang Jie
rest and recuperate after surgery.

01:10.480 --> 01:12.120
But with this profession of ours,

01:12.200 --> 01:14.640
how can I keep her in Shanghai?

01:14.720 --> 01:15.560
Well…

01:16.640 --> 01:17.480
But don't worry.

01:17.560 --> 01:18.840
I'll do everything I can

01:18.920 --> 01:20.200
to persuade her to go home

01:20.280 --> 01:21.480
and rest and recuperate there.

01:21.560 --> 01:22.520
That's right.

01:22.600 --> 01:24.080
She can treat it as a vacation.

01:30.920 --> 01:31.920
A vacation?

01:35.000 --> 01:38.040
This is my first vacation
ever since I joined the workforce.

01:38.120 --> 01:40.320
But since Wang Xixia, my hometown friend,

01:40.400 --> 01:42.040
colleague, and best friend,

01:42.120 --> 01:44.760
has already
made the necessary arrangement,

01:44.840 --> 01:46.920
I'll have no choice but to oblige.

02:03.200 --> 02:04.920
I've lived in Shanghai for many years.

02:05.000 --> 02:06.080
My hometown, Nanping,

02:06.160 --> 02:07.760
isn't as familiar to me.

02:08.800 --> 02:11.880
I only remember that it is a town
that is beside mountains and the ocean.

02:11.960 --> 02:13.440
There are 18 administrative villages

02:14.120 --> 02:15.800
and 26 natural villages.

02:15.880 --> 02:18.000
The total population is 390,000.

02:18.080 --> 02:19.600
There are listed pharmaceutical factories,

02:19.680 --> 02:21.760
electrical appliance factories,
and porcelain factories

02:21.840 --> 02:23.400
with revenue growth year after year.

02:23.480 --> 02:26.840
I heard
that the tourism sector was growing too.

02:29.960 --> 02:32.240
On the business streets
where influencers often check in,

02:32.320 --> 02:35.920
there is a stunning view.

02:36.720 --> 02:39.520
That is
Ms. Liao Tao's braised chicken shop!

02:39.600 --> 02:42.000
LIAOGEN BRAISED CHICKEN

02:42.680 --> 02:43.560
Liao Tao?

02:43.640 --> 02:44.960
You guys have seen her before.

02:45.040 --> 02:46.280
She's my mom.

02:47.480 --> 02:49.120
This woman whose mood changes rapidly

02:49.200 --> 02:51.280
and doesn't mean what she says

02:51.360 --> 02:53.000
got married to Mr. He

02:53.080 --> 02:54.360
with me and Zhuang Yan

02:54.440 --> 02:55.600
when she was 35 years old.

02:57.320 --> 02:59.000
Mr. He is my dad's old comrade.

02:59.080 --> 03:01.520
He doesn't speak much and is very kind.

03:01.600 --> 03:03.160
To us,

03:03.240 --> 03:05.280
he's the best stepdad in the world.

03:06.120 --> 03:08.280
Especially when the sensitive Zhuang Yan

03:08.360 --> 03:10.840
gradually became a thorn in my mom's eyes.

03:10.920 --> 03:13.000
As the lubricant of the family,

03:13.080 --> 03:14.920
Mr. He is an important member.

03:26.680 --> 03:28.280
When Ms. Liao Tao was 40,

03:28.360 --> 03:31.200
she gave birth to my sister, He Niaoniao.

03:31.280 --> 03:32.960
She's just like a spring breeze.

03:33.040 --> 03:35.680
She brought endless laughter
to me and Zhuang Yan.

03:35.760 --> 03:39.040
However, she also brought endless trouble
to my mom and Mr. He.

03:40.280 --> 03:41.240
However,

03:41.320 --> 03:42.880
even my family members don't know

03:42.960 --> 03:46.160
that there's one individual in Nanping
who left a deep impression on me.

03:46.240 --> 03:47.840
Although we haven't met for many years,

03:47.920 --> 03:50.360
and his personality
is still as eccentric as ever,

03:51.320 --> 03:52.560
I'm still happy

03:52.640 --> 03:54.680
to be able to reunite with him.

03:54.760 --> 03:55.960
That individual is

03:56.040 --> 03:56.880
Chen Maidong.

03:56.960 --> 03:58.040
Grandma.

03:58.680 --> 04:00.720
As for this…

04:04.600 --> 04:06.240
Isn't this Ms. Lin's expertise?

04:06.320 --> 04:07.400
You!

04:07.480 --> 04:08.560
Stop interrupting me.

04:08.640 --> 04:09.960
I'm already frustrated enough.

04:18.320 --> 04:21.040
If you ask me if they are fated,

04:21.120 --> 04:22.640
I don't think they are merely fated.

04:22.720 --> 04:23.680
Maybe there is

04:23.760 --> 04:26.120
a deeper bond between them.

04:27.640 --> 04:29.680
A deeper bond?

07:10.920 --> 07:15.880
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

07:18.960 --> 07:20.560
My son!

07:26.720 --> 07:29.280
My son!

07:29.360 --> 07:31.080
You were only 17!

07:31.160 --> 07:32.800
The cops and medical examiner just left.

07:32.880 --> 07:34.680
Confirmed accidental drowning
while swimming.

07:34.760 --> 07:36.200
It has been more than 36 hours.

07:37.080 --> 07:38.880
That child was only 17.

07:38.960 --> 07:41.440
He argued with his parents a few days ago.

07:41.520 --> 07:43.880
They thought that he was living
at his classmate's house.

07:43.960 --> 07:45.400
That's why they didn't look for him.

07:48.840 --> 07:49.680
My son!

07:49.760 --> 07:52.280
Please accept our condolences.
We're from Nanping Funeral Parlor.

07:52.360 --> 07:53.320
Leave your child to us.

07:53.400 --> 07:56.040
We'll make the necessary arrangements.
Please don't worry.

07:56.120 --> 07:58.440
-Let's go.
-My son!

07:59.600 --> 08:02.520
My son!

08:02.600 --> 08:03.640
Let's go.

08:06.640 --> 08:08.200
My son!

08:12.760 --> 08:14.600
Have you prepared
the gurney and the hearse?

08:14.680 --> 08:17.040
The road was hard to traverse.
We only arrived not long ago.

08:21.280 --> 08:22.880
Did that kid discover the victim?

08:22.960 --> 08:25.760
Yes. I think it's the kid we saw
in the restaurant yesterday.

08:25.840 --> 08:26.920
He's in shock.

08:27.480 --> 08:30.280
Even ordinary folks can't stand
the sight of a waterlogged corpse.

08:30.960 --> 08:32.159
Reconfirm it.

08:46.040 --> 08:48.360
Is your name Zhuang Yan?

08:52.280 --> 08:54.040
We're going to take his body back.

08:54.120 --> 08:55.320
Are you okay?

08:55.400 --> 08:56.840
Do you want us to notify
your family members to pick you up?

08:57.880 --> 09:00.040
Where are you guys taking him?

09:01.120 --> 09:02.680
To my workplace.

09:02.760 --> 09:03.920
We'll see him off on his last journey.

09:05.120 --> 09:06.240
I'll go as well.

09:07.200 --> 09:08.440
May I?

09:10.080 --> 09:11.400
Only family members

09:11.480 --> 09:12.840
are allowed to observe the rites.

09:13.800 --> 09:15.840
Just let me stay there for a while.

09:17.840 --> 09:18.760
Please.

09:21.080 --> 09:22.480
Xilun,

09:22.560 --> 09:23.760
take him to my car.

09:27.320 --> 09:28.360
Please follow me.

10:22.520 --> 10:23.640
Jie.

10:36.520 --> 10:37.720
Sorry. Please stop here.

10:44.600 --> 10:45.960
Let me take a breather.

11:00.520 --> 11:02.040
Xilun, head back first.

11:02.120 --> 11:03.080
Okay, Master.

11:16.760 --> 11:18.240
You can sit here and take a break.

11:18.840 --> 11:20.480
I might be very busy later.

11:20.560 --> 11:22.000
I may not have time to tend to you.

11:22.720 --> 11:24.320
I'm very sorry

11:24.400 --> 11:25.720
that you received such a shock.

11:27.240 --> 11:30.760
That boy is around my age, right?

11:41.120 --> 11:42.800
He was supposed
to take the NCEE next year.

11:43.760 --> 11:44.760
What's his name?

11:45.320 --> 11:46.360
Trust me.

11:46.920 --> 11:48.480
No matter how much you know about him,

11:48.560 --> 11:50.920
it won't help you
in alleviating your negative emotions.

11:53.160 --> 11:54.680
I always thought

11:55.520 --> 11:57.280
that things with names

11:57.760 --> 11:59.120
contain a soul.

12:01.160 --> 12:03.200
I'm sure he has a great name too.

12:04.720 --> 12:06.920
One such that his parents
expected great things from him.

12:07.600 --> 12:10.320
Maybe they hoped that he would
become someone extraordinary.

12:10.400 --> 12:11.480
Or maybe they hoped

12:11.560 --> 12:14.080
that he would live a long life in peace.

12:26.240 --> 12:27.280
Jie,

12:28.000 --> 12:29.040
that boy's life

12:29.120 --> 12:31.040
hasn't even started yet.

12:31.120 --> 12:33.440
He didn't even get to realize his dreams,

12:33.520 --> 12:34.720
and he's gone just like that.

12:35.880 --> 12:37.480
He didn't live a glorious life

12:37.560 --> 12:39.280
or have a memorial tablet
erected after him.

12:39.360 --> 12:40.440
Soon,

12:41.120 --> 12:42.840
no one in this world will remember him

12:42.920 --> 12:44.720
except for his parents.

12:46.000 --> 12:47.440
What's the point

12:48.640 --> 12:49.960
of a life like that?

12:56.480 --> 12:58.760
To humans, death is the most helpless,

12:59.920 --> 13:01.360
yet fairest event in our lives.

13:02.520 --> 13:04.120
The weight of one's ash

13:04.640 --> 13:06.960
weighs between 1,800 g to 3,100 g.

13:09.000 --> 13:11.440
Whether one was successful or not
doesn't matter.

13:12.800 --> 13:14.160
It's already meaningful

13:15.800 --> 13:17.320
as long as they have existed before.

13:18.320 --> 13:19.480
Yan,

13:20.520 --> 13:22.200
have you not heard of this saying before?

13:23.000 --> 13:25.960
Sometimes, misfortunes
do haunt good people too.

13:28.240 --> 13:29.600
I think you'll be able to understand

13:33.880 --> 13:35.040
if you just look at me.

13:40.040 --> 13:41.760
Someone once told me…

13:41.840 --> 13:44.560
Even a crutch can be used as a weapon.

13:46.680 --> 13:48.280
"Even a crutch can be used as a weapon."

13:48.360 --> 13:49.400
I believed him.

13:58.000 --> 13:59.920
That's why I'm doing pretty well now.

14:01.880 --> 14:04.320
Humans are very resilient.

14:04.880 --> 14:06.120
No matter if it's you

14:07.600 --> 14:09.120
or the parents of that child,

14:09.200 --> 14:10.680
everyone will get over it.

14:18.800 --> 14:20.040
I have to resume my work.

14:20.120 --> 14:21.360
You guys should head back soon.

14:26.240 --> 14:27.960
Come on, let's go home.

14:44.680 --> 14:45.960
Thank you.

15:22.000 --> 15:23.080
Is Zhuang Yan asleep?

15:24.920 --> 15:26.720
He took half of a sleeping pill.

15:26.800 --> 15:28.080
He finally fell asleep.

15:33.640 --> 15:36.200
Who told him to go to that remote area

15:36.280 --> 15:38.240
instead of staying at home?

15:39.040 --> 15:40.520
That's enough.

15:40.600 --> 15:42.680
Zhuang Yan didn't want
to encounter that either.

15:42.760 --> 15:44.200
Stop pulling a long face.

15:45.280 --> 15:47.320
I just think that he's too fragile

15:47.400 --> 15:49.320
as a man.

15:49.400 --> 15:50.480
Look at him.

15:50.560 --> 15:51.560
He's scared witless.

15:51.640 --> 15:54.480
He Niaoniao was the one
who found his pet for him.

15:54.560 --> 15:56.160
The coroner already said

15:56.240 --> 15:57.400
that the bloated corpse

15:57.480 --> 15:58.600
was a disturbing sight.

15:59.360 --> 16:00.720
Everyone has to take some time off
after seeing that.

16:00.800 --> 16:03.320
Besides, you shouldn't
just keep talking about gender.

16:03.400 --> 16:06.080
Who said that boys shouldn't cry
or be afraid?

16:06.160 --> 16:08.000
You're being sexist here.

16:08.080 --> 16:10.040
You always side with your brother.

16:10.120 --> 16:11.000
Everything is my fault.

16:11.880 --> 16:13.680
You said he was reliable.

16:14.360 --> 16:16.600
The only thing he's good at
is taking exams.

16:16.680 --> 16:19.320
He hasn't contributed
a single cent for the family yet,

16:19.400 --> 16:21.040
and now, he wants to quit school.

16:21.840 --> 16:23.520
It's just a thought.

16:23.600 --> 16:25.120
Don't jump to conclusions yet.

16:25.200 --> 16:26.440
Let's take a step back.

16:26.520 --> 16:28.200
All roads lead to Rome.

16:28.280 --> 16:29.680
Rome?

16:29.760 --> 16:32.560
If he can still rule over Nanping
after quitting school,

16:32.640 --> 16:34.160
I'll kneel and kowtow to him.

16:37.920 --> 16:40.200
How long does it take to cook this?

16:40.280 --> 16:41.440
You should sleep earlier.

16:41.520 --> 16:43.760
I think you're easily irritated
due to lack of sleep.

16:43.840 --> 16:45.520
Stop trying to analyze me.

16:46.320 --> 16:48.640
Do you think I want to stand here
and cook all night?

16:48.720 --> 16:50.680
I had enough of this long ago.

16:50.760 --> 16:52.480
I would've rented a factory building

16:52.560 --> 16:54.960
in the developmental zone last year
if it weren't for you guys.

16:55.040 --> 16:56.240
Everything would be automated.

16:56.320 --> 16:57.560
I wouldn't need to go through all of this.

16:58.840 --> 16:59.720
That's great.

16:59.800 --> 17:01.920
I fully support this notion of yours.

17:02.000 --> 17:03.120
Rent it?

17:03.200 --> 17:04.680
Do you expect me to sell my kidneys?

17:06.599 --> 17:08.800
My savings and Mr. He's savings

17:08.880 --> 17:11.000
were all used up
to buy houses for you three.

17:12.119 --> 17:13.359
Did you buy houses?

17:14.119 --> 17:15.160
Did you buy one for me too?

17:15.880 --> 17:17.200
Aren't you my daughter?

17:17.280 --> 17:18.760
Of course you have to be included.

17:19.680 --> 17:22.359
Mom, I already told you long ago.

17:22.440 --> 17:23.599
I won't return to this town.

17:23.680 --> 17:25.599
Even if you did buy it,
you should rent it out.

17:25.680 --> 17:28.359
Didn't you say
that all roads lead to Rome?

17:28.440 --> 17:30.960
The main focus is the road and Rome,

17:31.040 --> 17:32.960
not the countryside and Nanping.

17:34.000 --> 17:35.000
What?

17:35.560 --> 17:37.800
Do you want to talk
about the inner world with me as well?

17:38.520 --> 17:39.880
Is Shanghai your Rome?

17:39.960 --> 17:41.520
Is this town too small for you?

17:41.600 --> 17:43.080
That's not what I mean.

17:43.160 --> 17:44.760
What do you mean, then? Tell me.

17:45.360 --> 17:46.320
Tell me.

17:49.920 --> 17:51.280
My son is useless

17:51.360 --> 17:52.720
while my daughters make me worry.

17:53.480 --> 17:54.320
I…

17:54.400 --> 17:55.840
I wonder why I'm working so hard!

18:17.480 --> 18:19.400
Didn't I tell you to be frugal at home?

18:19.480 --> 18:21.680
So what if you're trendy?
No one is looking at you.

18:22.360 --> 18:24.280
Wear the anti-slip slippers
that He made for you.

18:30.280 --> 18:31.320
What?

18:31.400 --> 18:33.160
You should tell me if you're out of money.

18:33.240 --> 18:35.560
Your son isn't earning money,
but your daughter earns a lot.

18:36.240 --> 18:37.640
I don't want your money.

18:37.720 --> 18:39.880
What? Are you favoring your son
over your daughter now?

18:39.960 --> 18:42.360
You can only depend on your son
to continue your bloodline.

18:42.440 --> 18:44.440
Are you afraid
of owing your daughter a favor

18:44.520 --> 18:46.040
when she is trying to give you money?

18:53.640 --> 18:55.840
No one in this town
can win an argument against you three.

19:10.720 --> 19:11.840
Mom,

19:12.840 --> 19:15.440
I love to stay beside you and Mr. He.

19:22.360 --> 19:23.760
It's very comfortable.

19:26.240 --> 19:28.360
But it's too comfortable.

19:28.440 --> 19:30.160
It'll polish my determination away.

19:31.400 --> 19:33.200
I can stay here for a short while.

19:33.920 --> 19:35.520
But I cannot stay here
for the rest of my life.

19:37.920 --> 19:40.360
I have to strive to improve myself

19:41.120 --> 19:43.080
because I'm physically disabled.

19:45.000 --> 19:47.800
Ever since I got into university
in Shanghai, I had decided

19:49.240 --> 19:51.560
that I must be more determined
than ordinary people.

19:53.240 --> 19:55.600
I'm going to be Nanping's pride and joy.

19:57.200 --> 19:58.840
I'll spread my roots in Shanghai.

19:59.720 --> 20:01.000
I'm going

20:02.360 --> 20:04.280
to climb higher and higher

20:05.000 --> 20:06.720
so that I can see

20:07.520 --> 20:09.160
the beautiful view up there.

20:33.640 --> 20:34.680
LIAOGEN CHICKEN

20:34.760 --> 20:35.840
Here. Thank you.

20:35.920 --> 20:36.840
Okay.

20:38.160 --> 20:39.520
One chicken, right?

20:43.880 --> 20:45.080
Liao Tao, hurry up!

20:45.160 --> 20:46.440
Fill out this form for me.

20:51.240 --> 20:52.560
Where did you come from?

20:52.640 --> 20:54.040
You're sweating so much.

20:54.120 --> 20:56.360
Because I'm tied up in official duties.

20:56.440 --> 20:58.840
The mayor intends
to gather all the undergraduates

20:58.920 --> 21:01.400
who are studying or working
in other cities

21:01.480 --> 21:03.720
for a tea party
during the Labor Day holiday.

21:03.800 --> 21:05.760
I've been finding them
one household after another

21:05.840 --> 21:06.800
to complete the census.

21:06.880 --> 21:08.360
When I reached your household,

21:08.440 --> 21:10.560
I couldn't find
Zhuang Yan's household information.

21:10.640 --> 21:12.680
Look. This is so frustrating.

21:12.760 --> 21:14.320
It has been so many years.

21:14.400 --> 21:15.840
Just tell him to fill it out again.

21:15.920 --> 21:17.360
Look at what you're saying.

21:17.440 --> 21:20.360
I need to check
and update all these profiles every year.

21:20.440 --> 21:22.240
Do you think this is
about missing information?

21:22.320 --> 21:24.360
It's an insult to my professionalism!

21:24.440 --> 21:25.840
This is so infuriating.

21:30.920 --> 21:34.520
I have to say, menopause is terrible!

21:35.160 --> 21:36.920
Nothing goes right
and I can't stop eating.

21:37.000 --> 21:38.640
Sometimes, I even hate myself.

21:38.720 --> 21:39.920
Me too.

21:40.000 --> 21:42.440
This has nothing to do with menopause.

21:42.520 --> 21:44.640
If anyone is to blame, blame Zhuang Yan.

21:44.720 --> 21:46.960
Nothing goes well when he is involved.

21:47.960 --> 21:49.680
Why are you blaming him for it?

21:49.760 --> 21:51.360
What has this got to do with that child?

21:51.440 --> 21:53.280
You're lucky
that you don't have a son like him.

21:53.360 --> 21:55.400
One look at him
will cost you ten years of life.

21:55.480 --> 21:56.960
No one is perfect.

21:57.040 --> 21:59.960
You should be grateful
that you have a great daughter.

22:00.040 --> 22:01.880
Just now, I saw Zhuang Jie

22:01.960 --> 22:04.160
bringing He Niaoniao
to shop for clothes for you and He.

22:04.240 --> 22:05.760
How could they be the same?

22:05.840 --> 22:08.080
Zhuang Jie suffered together with me
since she was young.

22:08.760 --> 22:11.480
I don't want her to suffer anymore.

22:11.560 --> 22:14.280
Didn't you buy a house in town
for her in secret?

22:16.920 --> 22:19.400
That's if she appreciates it.
She even talked back last night.

22:19.480 --> 22:20.560
If I must say,

22:21.280 --> 22:23.440
with that leg of hers and her vigor,

22:23.520 --> 22:25.320
she won't find a husband easily
in Shanghai.

22:27.000 --> 22:28.120
Don't worry.

22:28.200 --> 22:29.400
You can leave this to me

22:29.480 --> 22:31.760
as long as she's willing to come back.

22:31.840 --> 22:33.120
Stop bragging.

22:33.200 --> 22:36.040
You should deal with that pesky Mrs. Chen
before you say anything else.

22:36.120 --> 22:36.960
My goodness.

22:37.040 --> 22:38.680
Mrs. Chen is truly something else.

22:38.760 --> 22:40.640
Now the entire town committee avoids her

22:40.720 --> 22:41.800
when they see her.

22:43.880 --> 22:45.440
In my opinion,

22:45.520 --> 22:47.880
I think the girl
who marries into her family

22:47.960 --> 22:49.640
must be the unluckiest girl in the world.

22:50.800 --> 22:51.760
Sometimes,

22:51.840 --> 22:54.960
I sympathize with Chen Maidong.

22:59.680 --> 23:02.360
Jie, I'll improve my grades
by myself, okay?

23:02.440 --> 23:03.880
Just leave me alone.

23:03.960 --> 23:04.800
Hurry up.

23:04.880 --> 23:07.000
Jie, are you taking me
to sign up for cram school?

23:07.080 --> 23:08.520
I won't waste my money on that.

23:08.600 --> 23:10.680
But I found a better way
for you to get lessons.

23:10.760 --> 23:11.720
But Jie!

23:11.800 --> 23:13.400
Shut up. No negotiations allowed.

23:15.200 --> 23:16.080
Jie?

23:17.200 --> 23:18.080
Mrs. Chen!

23:19.640 --> 23:20.920
Where are you going?

23:21.000 --> 23:23.240
I was planning
to buy some food from your shop

23:23.320 --> 23:24.560
since I wasn't cooking tonight.

23:24.640 --> 23:25.720
Go ahead. My mom is there.

23:25.800 --> 23:27.320
I'll tell her to give you a discount.

23:27.400 --> 23:28.640
Consider it as a thank you

23:28.720 --> 23:30.520
to Chen Maidong
for taking care of Zhuang Yan.

23:30.600 --> 23:31.520
No need for that.

23:31.600 --> 23:33.000
Indeed.

23:33.080 --> 23:34.040
From now on,

23:34.120 --> 23:35.960
we should help each other
since we're a family.

23:37.160 --> 23:38.800
What do you mean by "we're a family"?

23:39.600 --> 23:40.840
That means

23:40.920 --> 23:42.160
your sister, Zhuang Jie,

23:42.240 --> 23:44.200
and my grandson, Chen Maidong,

23:44.280 --> 23:45.920
are destined to get married.

23:47.440 --> 23:49.160
You see,

23:49.240 --> 23:51.000
no one can avoid their fate.

23:51.080 --> 23:53.120
You must've lost your mind.

23:53.200 --> 23:54.440
Wait.

23:54.520 --> 23:55.760
Come here.

24:01.000 --> 24:01.880
Jie,

24:01.960 --> 24:04.400
don't blame me for being frank.

24:04.480 --> 24:06.120
Both of you are adults now.

24:06.200 --> 24:07.600
There's nothing to be shy about.

24:07.680 --> 24:09.440
I've done divination for you two.

24:09.520 --> 24:12.160
Ma'am, we don't believe in superstition.

24:12.240 --> 24:13.120
All right, then.

24:13.200 --> 24:15.160
Let's talk about it objectively.

24:15.800 --> 24:17.000
Are you single?

24:20.800 --> 24:23.040
You are about the same age as Maidong.

24:23.120 --> 24:25.200
And you two
know each other pretty well, right?

24:27.920 --> 24:29.840
That settles it, then.

24:29.920 --> 24:32.080
Look at him. He's handsome.

24:32.160 --> 24:33.520
You're very beautiful.

24:33.600 --> 24:36.600
There's no reason for you two
not to be with each other.

24:37.640 --> 24:38.480
Mrs. Chen,

24:38.560 --> 24:40.840
thank you for taking a liking to me.

24:42.280 --> 24:43.960
To be honest,

24:44.040 --> 24:45.920
I did have feelings for your grandson.

24:51.280 --> 24:54.560
Back in high school,
I thought Chen Maidong was pretty nice.

24:54.640 --> 24:56.320
But it was so long ago.

24:56.400 --> 24:59.560
Scientists said that human cells

24:59.640 --> 25:01.080
are renewed once every seven years.

25:01.160 --> 25:02.320
Now we're totally different.

25:02.400 --> 25:03.560
I don't have feelings for him.

25:03.640 --> 25:04.880
He's like a stranger to me.

25:04.960 --> 25:06.640
That's even better.

25:06.720 --> 25:08.040
Get to know each other again.

25:08.120 --> 25:09.280
It'll be fun!

25:09.360 --> 25:10.800
I came back to Nanping for vacation.

25:10.880 --> 25:12.720
I'll be returning to Shanghai soon.

25:13.800 --> 25:15.120
Chen Maidong and I

25:15.200 --> 25:16.760
can only be friends.

25:16.840 --> 25:17.920
I mustn't ruin his future.

25:19.520 --> 25:20.680
Thanks.

25:21.640 --> 25:22.520
Hey!

25:23.440 --> 25:24.920
Jie, listen to me.

25:25.000 --> 25:25.840
I'm not lying!

25:25.920 --> 25:27.960
You two are truly destined to be together!

25:29.800 --> 25:30.880
Thanks.

25:31.960 --> 25:33.360
Thanks, my foot.

25:35.280 --> 25:36.280
Let's go!

25:40.680 --> 25:43.000
Grandma, that's the second time.

25:43.080 --> 25:45.720
Can you please stop embarrassing me
in front of other people?

25:45.800 --> 25:47.200
Zhuang Jie and I aren't close.

25:47.280 --> 25:48.560
Stay out of this.

25:48.640 --> 25:49.800
Grandma.

25:49.880 --> 25:50.800
Be honest with me.

25:50.880 --> 25:53.840
Have I ever tried this hard
to help you court a girl before this?

25:53.920 --> 25:56.200
Why did you have to pick Zhuang Jie?

25:58.960 --> 26:00.520
Did Ms. Lin put a spell over you?

26:01.280 --> 26:02.880
Don't slander her.

26:02.960 --> 26:04.040
Lin has been teaching me

26:04.120 --> 26:06.000
how to recite poems lately.

26:06.080 --> 26:07.360
Recite poems?

26:07.440 --> 26:08.720
That sounds scary.

26:08.800 --> 26:09.920
What kinds of poems?

26:10.000 --> 26:11.080
Chen Maidong,

26:11.160 --> 26:12.880
you're overstepping your boundaries.

26:12.960 --> 26:14.760
Do you think you can test me now?

26:14.840 --> 26:15.840
I dare not do so.

26:15.920 --> 26:17.760
I just wish to translate it for you.

26:17.840 --> 26:20.400
Maybe I can make up a version
that's unrelated to Zhuang Jie.

26:21.600 --> 26:23.640
Heaven's secrets are not to be divulged.

26:23.720 --> 26:25.520
I've already made up my mind.

26:25.600 --> 26:27.160
Since you're not doing it yourself,

26:27.240 --> 26:30.040
I'm casting away my pride
to court Jie on your behalf.

26:31.200 --> 26:32.080
Grandma.

26:34.000 --> 26:35.280
Grandma!

26:35.840 --> 26:37.640
Can you stop messing around?

26:37.720 --> 26:39.160
Fine.

26:39.240 --> 26:40.880
I'll give you a second choice.

26:40.960 --> 26:42.480
Tell your parents to come here.

26:42.560 --> 26:45.080
Have them bring their spouses
and family members.

26:45.160 --> 26:47.880
We'll hold an official family meeting

26:47.960 --> 26:49.880
and talk about your personal issues.

26:52.720 --> 26:54.240
There's no need to resort to that.

26:56.120 --> 26:57.640
Now you know

26:57.720 --> 26:59.240
the definition of messing around.

27:06.320 --> 27:07.280
Fine.

27:08.080 --> 27:10.280
I'll consider it seriously.

27:11.200 --> 27:12.640
Kid,

27:12.720 --> 27:14.480
I assume your skills in picking up girls

27:14.560 --> 27:15.800
haven't grown rusty yet, right?

27:17.240 --> 27:19.280
I never had that skill in the first place.

27:19.360 --> 27:20.440
All the girls court me.

27:22.600 --> 27:23.960
Cocky, aren't you?

27:24.040 --> 27:25.800
I dare you to be cocky again!

27:28.880 --> 27:29.720
Brat!

27:47.360 --> 27:49.560
This time, He Niaoniao really is studying.

27:49.640 --> 27:52.320
Her whiteboard looked full.

27:54.080 --> 27:55.520
Really?

27:55.600 --> 27:56.480
Really.

27:58.440 --> 28:00.240
Is that class monitor of hers a wizard?

28:00.320 --> 28:03.160
Did he change the nature
of an underachiever in one afternoon?

28:03.240 --> 28:05.080
Teach students
according to their aptitude.

28:05.160 --> 28:06.320
He Niaoniao likes cute guys.

28:06.400 --> 28:08.600
Her class monitor is upright and handsome.

28:08.680 --> 28:10.760
Of course she'll study hard
if he tutors her.

28:10.840 --> 28:11.760
Great job.

28:11.840 --> 28:13.920
The thing is, why did he agree to it?

28:14.640 --> 28:16.240
Zhuang Jie,

28:16.320 --> 28:17.840
did you do something drastic again?

28:19.160 --> 28:21.360
You're the best
at belittling your children.

28:21.440 --> 28:23.880
If He Niaoniao wants to please someone,

28:23.960 --> 28:25.440
no one in the world can stop her.

28:27.000 --> 28:29.080
Do you think being witty alone
could make this work?

28:29.160 --> 28:30.560
She must've spent a lot of money.

28:31.120 --> 28:32.720
Of course I couldn't be empty-handed.

28:32.800 --> 28:34.080
I bought him some tonics.

28:34.160 --> 28:35.600
But that's not what he was after.

28:35.680 --> 28:38.280
He's mainly grateful to me
for getting a checkup for his grandpa

28:38.360 --> 28:40.240
at the provincial hospital
at an insider's price.

28:40.920 --> 28:41.880
Look at her.

28:41.960 --> 28:44.640
Nowadays, you have to go so far
just to please someone.

28:45.680 --> 28:46.840
You know nothing.

28:47.400 --> 28:48.560
You think that you can survive

28:48.640 --> 28:50.680
just by carrying an art canvas around.

28:50.760 --> 28:53.440
You won't sell any paintings
if you don't have social skills.

28:54.240 --> 28:55.760
I have Jie.

28:55.840 --> 28:57.480
She can promote even He Niaoniao.

28:57.560 --> 28:59.040
I'm sure she can sell my paintings.

29:00.200 --> 29:02.600
Madam Wu wants you to go
to the mayor's tea party tomorrow.

29:02.680 --> 29:04.120
Tell me whether you're going or not.

29:04.760 --> 29:06.000
I don't have social skills.

29:06.080 --> 29:07.560
Tell Jie to go on my behalf.

29:08.120 --> 29:10.000
Fine, I'll go.

29:10.080 --> 29:11.360
Zhuang Yan, keep up the momentum.

29:11.440 --> 29:12.680
Monitor He Niaoniao's studies.

29:12.760 --> 29:13.680
Okay.

29:37.680 --> 29:39.520
What? You're being so sneaky.

29:39.600 --> 29:42.640
Yan, you now have two choices.

29:42.720 --> 29:44.640
Either you sit here as an audience

29:44.720 --> 29:46.040
or join me in solving this issue.

29:47.040 --> 29:49.240
I choose neither.
You must be up to no good again.

29:50.000 --> 29:51.720
-Mom.
-Yan!

30:02.000 --> 30:02.840
Yan.

30:03.760 --> 30:05.400
I assume you don't know him.

30:05.480 --> 30:06.760
What makes you think so?

30:06.840 --> 30:07.840
This is Maidong.

30:07.920 --> 30:09.280
He's an outstanding person.

30:09.360 --> 30:10.760
Has he won your heart too

30:10.840 --> 30:12.000
in just a few days?

30:12.080 --> 30:13.720
What do you mean by that?

30:13.800 --> 30:16.000
Where did you find out all this about him?

30:16.080 --> 30:17.920
Jie must not get together

30:18.000 --> 30:20.440
with Chen Maidong.

30:20.520 --> 30:21.360
Why?

30:21.440 --> 30:24.400
It's because Jie
let her tongue slip today.

30:24.480 --> 30:26.520
I did have feelings for your grandson.

30:26.600 --> 30:28.520
But it was so long ago.

30:29.000 --> 30:30.080
What?

30:31.120 --> 30:32.600
Isn't it peculiar?

30:32.680 --> 30:34.560
Both of us were kept in the dark.

30:36.680 --> 30:38.040
You almost had me duped.

30:38.120 --> 30:40.280
I was only four when Jie was transferred

30:40.360 --> 30:41.440
to the high school here.

30:41.520 --> 30:43.560
You weren't even born yet.
You don't know anything.

30:43.640 --> 30:44.680
That's not the point here.

30:44.760 --> 30:46.480
The thing is, our sister was always frank.

30:46.560 --> 30:48.240
Why has she never
mentioned her first love?

30:49.520 --> 30:50.920
First love?

30:51.000 --> 30:52.400
Why are you jumping to conclusions?

30:52.960 --> 30:55.840
Yan, they've had a peculiar relationship
since high school.

30:55.920 --> 30:58.240
All high schoolers and middle schoolers
knew about it.

30:58.320 --> 30:59.400
Why was it so well-known?

30:59.480 --> 31:01.520
It was because they didn't
suit each other.

31:01.600 --> 31:03.640
Anyway, I have plenty of reason

31:03.720 --> 31:05.160
to suspect that Chen Maidong

31:05.240 --> 31:07.520
has been in Jie's heart all these years.

31:07.600 --> 31:10.120
He's using psychic powers
to gaslight our sister,

31:10.200 --> 31:12.680
causing her to remain single until now.

31:25.520 --> 31:30.520
HONGXU CARGO TERMINAL

31:30.600 --> 31:32.440
-Pass.
-I don't have any.

31:32.520 --> 31:33.920
-None?
-Who dealt these hands?

31:34.000 --> 31:35.080
He's here.

31:35.160 --> 31:36.160
Six!

31:37.360 --> 31:38.440
Why don't you join us?

31:39.160 --> 31:40.240
You're finally free today.

31:40.320 --> 31:41.600
Go.

31:41.680 --> 31:43.320
-Six.
-Nine.

31:43.400 --> 31:44.360
Ten.

31:44.440 --> 31:45.480
Circle.

31:46.320 --> 31:47.440
Joker of diamonds.

31:47.520 --> 31:48.680
Joker of spades.

31:48.760 --> 31:49.880
My turn.

31:49.960 --> 31:52.120
-Pass.
-Pass.

31:52.200 --> 31:53.680
A pair of eights.

31:55.360 --> 31:57.560
Are you hiding out
because your grandma whooped your butt?

31:57.640 --> 31:59.160
Shut up.

32:00.640 --> 32:02.120
Maidong,

32:02.200 --> 32:03.760
why did I hear

32:03.840 --> 32:06.120
that your grandma
stopped a girl in public?

32:08.680 --> 32:10.280
There's no use staring at me.

32:10.360 --> 32:11.720
Our town is so tiny.

32:11.800 --> 32:13.440
It takes two hours for gossip to spread.

32:15.000 --> 32:16.880
Just don't spread it to me.

32:20.520 --> 32:22.440
Do you know who his grandma
stopped in public?

32:22.520 --> 32:23.560
Who was it?

32:23.640 --> 32:24.800
Zhuang Jie.

32:25.360 --> 32:27.240
The girl who transferred
to our high school

32:27.320 --> 32:28.320
who can't walk properly.

32:28.400 --> 32:29.760
Her?

32:29.840 --> 32:31.040
Enough.

32:31.120 --> 32:32.840
I saw her on the streets two days ago.

32:32.920 --> 32:35.280
She looked like a normal person to me.

32:35.360 --> 32:38.200
The medical technology of modern cities
is amazing indeed.

32:38.280 --> 32:39.120
You don't say?

32:39.200 --> 32:40.720
I didn't dare to speak with her

32:40.800 --> 32:42.240
when I saw her leg in the past.

32:42.320 --> 32:45.360
It felt as if she was very depressed.

32:45.440 --> 32:46.520
Change the topic.

32:46.600 --> 32:48.120
Let's change the topic.

32:48.200 --> 32:49.280
Four.

32:49.360 --> 32:50.320
Six.

32:51.200 --> 32:53.160
Now, Zhuang Jie

32:53.240 --> 32:54.880
is totally different.

32:54.960 --> 32:56.280
Standing in a crowd,

32:56.360 --> 32:57.600
she's eye-catching.

32:57.680 --> 32:58.720
She's beautiful.

32:58.800 --> 32:59.960
It's no wonder his grandma

33:00.040 --> 33:01.320
is obsessed with her.

33:02.920 --> 33:05.400
I told you to change the topic!

33:06.360 --> 33:08.680
Chen Maidong, don't push your luck.

33:11.080 --> 33:12.720
Right now, we feel the same

33:12.800 --> 33:15.160
as your grandma.

33:21.400 --> 33:23.080
When you were in high school,

33:23.160 --> 33:26.320
you were well-known as a rich man's son

33:26.400 --> 33:28.800
with a terrible temper and strong fists.

33:28.880 --> 33:29.720
But now?

33:29.800 --> 33:31.320
He's left on the shelf!

33:31.400 --> 33:32.720
What's going on?

33:34.920 --> 33:37.840
If I must say, you should rekindle
your past relationship

33:37.920 --> 33:38.840
with Zhuang Jie.

33:38.920 --> 33:40.400
Rekindle, my foot.

33:41.120 --> 33:42.640
You were the ones who spread the rumor.

33:43.440 --> 33:44.600
Who said so?

33:44.680 --> 33:46.480
We dare not do so.

33:46.560 --> 33:47.560
You see…

33:47.640 --> 33:49.520
-there's no smoke without fire.
-There's no smoke without fire.

33:50.960 --> 33:53.080
No smoke without fire, right?

33:53.160 --> 33:55.200
What? Let's talk this over.
Don't get violent.

33:55.280 --> 33:58.040
Chen Maidong, you act decent at work.

33:58.120 --> 34:00.280
Why do you act like a thug
when you come here?

34:00.360 --> 34:01.480
Should I state the obvious?

34:01.560 --> 34:03.160
Go ahead.

34:04.080 --> 34:05.520
If you don't have a good point,

34:05.600 --> 34:07.080
I'll make sure you learn your lesson!

34:07.920 --> 34:09.239
Stop! What are you doing?

34:11.080 --> 34:12.120
Chen Maidong!

34:12.199 --> 34:15.000
You know full well
how that scandal with Zhuang Jie started.

34:15.080 --> 34:16.639
Back then, you were a total fool.

34:16.719 --> 34:20.360
How could you fall under the control
of an unremarkable disabled girl?

34:44.280 --> 34:45.679
Quiet down.

34:47.080 --> 34:47.960
Quiet down.

34:49.239 --> 34:50.639
You are participating in a play,

34:50.719 --> 34:51.800
not the circus.

34:51.880 --> 34:53.920
You'll lose your voice
if you keep this up.

34:55.159 --> 34:56.199
Let's take a picture.

34:56.280 --> 34:57.320
By the way, miss,

34:57.400 --> 34:58.760
we still need two more trees.

34:59.480 --> 35:01.920
I thought Song Wei and Li Yang
were supposed to be the trees.

35:02.000 --> 35:02.960
They don't want to do it

35:03.040 --> 35:05.360
because trees have no lines
and wanted to be guards instead.

35:06.280 --> 35:07.400
Then…

35:12.680 --> 35:14.280
Zhuang Jie,

35:14.360 --> 35:15.880
are you willing to participate

35:15.960 --> 35:18.000
and make some fun high school memories

35:18.080 --> 35:19.320
along the way?

35:22.480 --> 35:23.640
But don't force yourself

35:23.720 --> 35:25.440
if you're afraid it's too much for you.

35:26.800 --> 35:27.760
I'm in.

35:29.360 --> 35:30.480
But

35:31.600 --> 35:33.200
we need two trees, right?

35:33.280 --> 35:34.640
One tree will do.

35:34.720 --> 35:36.160
The main point is your participation.

35:39.720 --> 35:40.880
What about Chen Maidong?

35:41.560 --> 35:43.080
He doesn't have a role either.

35:44.760 --> 35:45.600
He and I

35:45.680 --> 35:46.760
will be the two trees.

35:50.400 --> 35:51.400
Chen Maidong.

35:53.160 --> 35:55.160
It's rare for Zhuang Jie
to participate in an event.

35:55.240 --> 35:56.840
Stop pretending to be sick.

35:56.920 --> 35:59.200
You two can play the trees together, okay?

36:08.080 --> 36:09.000
Fine.

36:15.080 --> 36:16.080
Take a few more pictures.

39:34.600 --> 39:41.320
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
